# krovikan_vampire.txt: the Bears die to damage Krovikan Vampire dealt, so its
# Static$ True dies trigger remembers them inline (Pump | RememberObjects$
# TriggeredCard). At the end step X (Remembered$Amount) is 1, so TrigChange
# puts the Bears (Creature.IsRemembered+ThisTurnEnteredFrom_Battlefield) onto
# the battlefield under the Vampire's controller.
startturn ai
advance 5
queue attackers 2
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks 1=2
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
advance 3
resolvestack
